  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "So far, we've celebrated Cakey's treats,"
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "DJ's beats,"
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "and Carlita's cat-tastic streets."
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "Vroom, vroom!"
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "Beep, beep!"
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "And we have even more to go."
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "Who's our next Gabby Cat? Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "\"This cardboard cutie"
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "loves glitter and glue,"
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "pom-poms and polka dots,"
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "and crafting with you.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "I think I know who this is."
  },
  {
    "index": 353,
    "text": "Who's it gonna be this time?"
  },
  {
    "index": 354,
    "text": "It's me, Baby Box!"
  },
  {
    "index": 355,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 356,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 357,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 358,
    "text": "Hiya, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 359,
    "text": "Hi, Baby Box. Ready for your question?"
  },
  {
    "index": 360,
    "text": "You know it."
  },
  {
    "index": 361,
    "text": "\"What are some of your favorite moments"
  },
  {
    "index": 362,
    "text": "that make it good to be a Gabby Cat?\""
  },
  {
    "index": 363,
    "text": "Well…"
  },
  {
    "index": 364,
    "text": "Doodles and doodads!"
  },
  {
    "index": 365,
    "text": "It's got to be"
  },
  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "all the crafty-riffic adventures we have."
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "Take a look."
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "Let's get crafting!"
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "With our trusty glue stick"
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "and some imagination,"
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "we can make any creation."
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "♪ Let's make, create and decorate"
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "A crafty-riffic day ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "♪ I wouldn't have it any other way ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "♪ Go ahead and take one, shake one"
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "Learn how to make one ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "♪ Oh, so shaker-riffic ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "♪ We're shake-shake-shakin' today ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "♪ Let's make something together today ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "The thing I love about googly eyes is…"
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "They're so silly!"
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "♪ Googly-goo, goo-goo-goo-googlify ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "♪ Whatever you want"
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "Just add googly eyes ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "♪ Stick 'em on a phone or a blob of clay ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "-♪ A toilet paper roll or a kitty tail ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "-Hey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "♪ It's your imagination, so let it fly ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "♪ Everything's better with googly eyes ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "Let's get crafting."
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "♪ There's a furr-ocious dragon"
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "Who has our precious key ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "♪ We need to get it back"
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "So we can set the king free ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "-♪ We've got ourselves a plan ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "-♪ It's pretty crafty ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "♪ Huzzah! Huzzah! Huzzah! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "♪ We can't approach as knights"
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "The dragon's very wise ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "♪ What we need is a great disguise ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "♪ We better work together"
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "If this plan is gonna fly ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "♪ Huzzah! Huzzah! Huzzah! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "♪ The crayons, sprinkle glitter"
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "And don't forget the glue ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "♪ Give it teeth and claws"
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "And dragon horns too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "♪ That furr-ocious dragon"
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "Will have no clue ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "♪ That it's me and you, huzzah! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "♪ So, come, brave knights"
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "Let's get out there ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "♪ It's our noble duty ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "♪ To get that key ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "♪ To set the king free ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "♪ And save the ceremony ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "♪ Get that key, set the king free ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "♪ Huzzah! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "It's perfect!"
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "♪ Now I got my trusty glue stick ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "♪ A sewing machine"
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "And I know how to use it ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "♪ We can build anything"
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "If we stick together ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "Oops!"
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "♪ Jewels and gems and macaroni ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "♪ Just like my mama told me ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 428,
    "text": "♪ Glitter makes everything better"
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "It's true ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "♪ They say if you got it, flaunt it"
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "I say put a pom-pom on it ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "♪ And let's get crafting ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "♪ Yeah, let's get crafting ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "We've sure been looking at a lot of stuff."
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "I wonder what's next."
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "\"This Gabby Cat's funny,"
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "his color is blue."
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "And ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "He may pull a trick or two.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "Hmm. Do you know who it is?"
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "Who could it be?"
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "Finally, some CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "A toodley-doo-hoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "Huh. Where did he go?"
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "Over here."
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "We've seen"
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "a lot of Gabby Cat moments today,"
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "but not enough CatRat moments."
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "Don't worry, I'm here to fix that."
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "It's CatRat time!"
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "♪ I think we can all agree ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "♪ That a problem or two or three ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "♪ Gives a story some zing ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "♪ It would be boring"
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "Without the good bad guys like me ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "♪ You see ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "♪ Every story needs a bad guy ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "♪ Yes, a good guy too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "♪ I'm gonna make a fuss, run amok ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "♪ I'm gonna give that good guy"
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "Something to do ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "Don't worry, buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "We're here to save the... Oof!"
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "…day?"
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "For a bad guy, you're awfully cute."
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "What?!"
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "Whoa! Da-da-da! Bad guys don't hug."
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "Well, okay. Maybe just a little."
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "Ha! Oof!"
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "Ooh! Hello, handsome."
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "-You do play a good bad guy, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "-I know!"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "-Hi!"
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "-Hey."
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "Oh, hello."
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "♪ Every story needs a bad guy ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "♪ Yes, a good guy too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "♪ I'm gonna make a fuss"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "I'm gonna run amok ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "♪ Gonna give that good guy"
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "Something to do ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "Ooh! Hello."
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "Ah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "Ah…"
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "Hi, CatRat. I'm Spongey."
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "Watch the sardines!"
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "And as we all know by now, shiny is miney."
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "Hello, handsome cake!"
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "Mm…"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "I love it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "-Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "-♪ Silly bad guys mean no harm ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "♪ They're doing their thing"
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "Adding charm to the story ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "♪ Leaving glory to the good guys ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "♪ Now, how about one more bow? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "♪ Every story needs a bad guy ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "♪ Yes, a good guy too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "♪ I'm gonna make a fuss, gonna run amok ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "♪ I'm gonna give that good guy"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "Something to do ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "♪ I cause problems"
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "The good guy solves 'em ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "♪ I learn a little lesson too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "♪ I'm the bad guy, ha-ha ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "♪ So good at what I do ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "Yep, it's good to be a CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "Floyd!"
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "Floyd!"
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "Floyd definitely knows"
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "how good it is to be a Gabby Cat."
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "Hi, Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "♪ He's the greatest kitty around ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "♪ Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "♪ Our Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 523,
    "text": "♪ Having a snack, taking a nap"
  },
  {
    "index": 524,
    "text": "Dressing up with me ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 525,
    "text": "-♪ Floyd, our Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 526,
    "text": "-All right!"
  },
  {
    "index": 527,
    "text": "♪ He's, oh, so cuddly ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 528,
    "text": "♪ Our fluffy bundle of joy ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 529,
    "text": "♪ What do you think of that, Floyd? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 530,
    "text": "♪ Our Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 531,
    "text": "♪ Our Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 532,
    "text": "♪ So silly, soft, and sweet ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 533,
    "text": "♪ Our Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 534,
    "text": "♪ Our Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 535,
    "text": "♪ And those snuggles can't be beat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 536,
    "text": "-Come on, Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 537,
    "text": "-♪ Our Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 538,
    "text": "♪ Our Floyd ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 539,
    "text": "♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 540,
    "text": "Aww, we love you, Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 541,
    "text": "Bye, Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 542,
    "text": "And now for our last contestant."
  },
  {
    "index": 543,
    "text": "\"He's white and black,"
  },
  {
    "index": 544,
    "text": "he has a snack in his pack,"
  },
  {
    "index": 545,
